flowchart LR
  D[Historical CSV or future sensor gateway] --> V{Quality validation}
  V -->|invalid| Q[Quality review and repair]
  V -->|valid| F[Past only feature engineering]
  R[Verified normal reference] --> T[Earlier 70 percent fit]
  R --> C[Later 30 percent calibration]
  T --> M[Isolation Forest]
  C --> H[Quantile threshold]
  F --> M
  M --> S[Anomaly score and context]
  H --> S
  S --> P[Persistence and separate critical rules]
  P --> A[Inspection ticket]
  A --> I[Human acknowledgement inspection and resolution]
  I --> E[Expert review of feedback and drift]
  E -. versioned update only .-> R
